    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Binary writer that persists bytes to a file. Uses an internal std::ofstream with an optional 4096-byte write buffer. Also supports parallel offset-based writes via an internal thread pool after the file has been pre-allocated with pre_allocate(). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
